From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: expose Frame container accessibility

Expose the GTK4 Frame drawing container as a named group for assistive
technology. Frame geometry, reveal animation, and input controllers are
unchanged.

--- a/src/jarabe/frame/framewindow.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/frame/framewindow.py
@@ -49,1 +49,3 @@
         super().__init__()
+        self.update_property([Gtk.AccessibleProperty.LABEL], [_('Frame')])
+        self.set_accessible_role(Gtk.AccessibleRole.GROUP)
